{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0090-s001", "text": "Elever i årskurs ett och två eller i specialundervisning kan få delta i morgon- och eftermiddagsverksamhet för skolelever.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025632899426+0000-13/hb-c08-u0090-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.249298095703125, "generation_seconds": 21.61125162616372, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0090-s002", "text": "Det ordnas verksamhet på många skolor före eller efter skoldagen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025632899426+0000-13/hb-c08-u0090-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.2530517578125, "generation_seconds": 14.457866528071463, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0090-s003", "text": "Eftermiddagsklubbar kan ordnas också i andra än skolans lokaler.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025632899426+0000-13/hb-c08-u0090-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.427825927734375, "generation_seconds": 16.603524084901437, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0090-s004", "text": "Föräldrarna ska i förväg ansöka om en plats för sitt barn i morgon- eller eftermiddagsverksamhet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025632899426+0000-13/hb-c08-u0090-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.319915771484375, "generation_seconds": 25.755867569940165, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0090-s005", "text": "Antalet platser är begränsat.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025632899426+0000-13/hb-c08-u0090-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.387847900390625, "generation_seconds": 10.57542214798741, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0090-s006", "text": "Kommunen kan ta ut en avgift för deltagande i verksamheten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025632899426+0000-13/hb-c08-u0090-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.276580810546875, "generation_seconds": 16.52868949016556, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0091-s001", "text": "Morgon- och eftermiddagsverksamheten är avsedd särskilt för barn med föräldrar som arbetar heltid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025632899426+0000-13/hb-c08-u0091-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.777142857142858, "peak": 0.308441162109375, "generation_seconds": 29.755707894917578, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0091-s002", "text": "Med hjälp av verksamheten behöver barnet inte vara ensamt hemma på eftermiddagarna, utan får tillbringa dem i en trygg miljö tillsammans med handledare och andra barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T025632899426+0000-13/hb-c08-u0091-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.931972789115646, "peak": 0.2760009765625, "generation_seconds": 41.72872892790474, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
